    "%lld pages kept. Older pages are removed." : {
      "comment" : "Caption under the Keep history for row, saying how many pages the history holds now and that anything past the chosen age is dropped. %lld is the count of pages; use a plural variation if the language needs one. The alternative caption, shown when the history is empty, is No pages recorded yet."
    },
