            "value" : "%1$lld%% used (%2$lld%% left)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`%@` is saved in your Keychain." : {
      "comment" : "Caption under the API key row when a key is stored and can be shown partly hidden. %@ is the masked form of the key, for example the first and last few characters — leave it as it is. The backticks mark it as code and must be kept; Keychain is Apple’s password store, so use Apple’s own name for it."
    },
