    },
    "Add an API key for %@ in Settings, or enable Apple Intelligence" : {
      "comment" : "Status message when the chosen provider has no key and there is no fallback. %@ is the provider's name, e.g. OpenAI, Anthropic or Ollama. “Apple Intelligence” is Apple's product name and “Settings” is the app's Settings window."
    },
