    "Add extensions" : {
      "comment" : "Heading of the third onboarding screen, where the reader installs browser extensions in one click. An extension is an add-on that changes how websites behave."
    },
    "Add extensions from the Chrome Web Store or Firefox Add-ons." : {
      "comment" : "Caption under the Add extensions heading. These refers to the extensions listed below it. Chrome and Firefox are browser names and are never translated; their stores are the websites the extensions are downloaded from, and opening a store page in Linen is how the reader installs more."
    },
    "Add Inspect Element to a page’s right-click menu." : {

    },
    "Add Key…" : {
