      "comment" : "Button beside the field where a model identifier is typed by hand in Settings > Provider. A verb (a command)."
    },
    "ask" : {
      "comment" : "Hint word printed beside a key cap under the address field — “⌘ ↩ ask” beside the Return hint, and “↩ ask” when the line starts with @ or when the browser is set to agent-only input. It means: send this to the assistant. One lowercase verb, tiny type."
    },
    "Ask" : {
