    },
    "The assistant can use tools from connected MCP services. Linen asks you to approve each tool call." : {

    },
    "The assistant may do these without asking: %@. Change this in Assistant settings." : {
      "comment" : "Note on a website's page when the assistant holds standing permission there. %@ is a list of action kinds already worded and joined, for example purchases and money transfers. Assistant is the name of a Settings page."
    },
    "The assistant uses AI and is not a person. Responses can be wrong. Check important information." : {

    },
    "The assistant wants to click “%@” %@. This %@ and usually can’t be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
