    "update.banner.downloadingShare" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the software-update button in the sidebar while a release is being fetched. %@ is an already-formatted percentage and carries its own per-cent sign. Kept separate from “Downloading %@”, where %@ is a version number instead. The button is narrow, so keep this short.",
